%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: collegequest2.5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792069
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Fascinating, it seems we've unearthed a section of tombs previously unknown
      to us!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, let me just examine-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Suddenly, a light-blue light envelopes the room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792102
    - rid: 4351267964947792104
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Mr. Tolfdir, what's happening?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792103
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Mr. Tolfdir...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792105
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori's pleas seem to fall on deaf ears.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792106
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hold mage, and listen well...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792108
    - rid: 4351267964947792109
    - rid: 268099795830177891
    - rid: 4972360475574796407
    - rid: 1790118692274307135
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Know that you have set in motion a chain of events that cannot be stopped.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307136
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Judgement has not been passed, as you had no way of knowing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Judgement will be passed on your actions to come, and how you deal with
      the dangers ahead of you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: This warning is passed to you because the Psijic Order believes in you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Only you and your companion have the potential to prevent disaster.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792110
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Take great care, and know that the Order is watching...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I felt a surge of magical energy just now... what happened?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792111
    - rid: 4351267964947792113
    - rid: 4351267964947792114
    - rid: 268099795830177892
    - rid: 4972360475574796408
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792115
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, some weird guy in yellow robes came in to warn me about some impending
      disaster...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792117
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: A... strange man in yellow robes...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, he said he was speaking for a Shijick order, or something...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you mean Psijic? The Psijic Order?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792118
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah, that one.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792119
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. As far as I know, the Psijics don't have any connection to these
      ruins...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Perhaps we should start by getting a look inside these coffins.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Remember to be very careful, these coffins can contain-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The coffin directly ahead of the podium opens itself, revealing a draugr
      waiting on the other side.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267964947792120
    - rid: 4351267964947792121
    - rid: 4351267964947792122
    - rid: 4351267988772749389
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749312
    - rid: 4351267988772749313
    - rid: 4351267988772749314
    - rid: 4351267988772749316
    - rid: 4351267988772749317
    - rid: 4351267988772749318
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749388
    - rid: 4351267988772749404
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh my, this is marvelous!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749390
    - rid: 4351267988772749391
    - rid: 4351267988772749405
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749393
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749395
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749397
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749398
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749399
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: This centralized chamber contains several entombed Nords...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I wonder what the significance could be-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: All around them, draugr emerge from their tombs.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749406
    - rid: 4351267988772749407
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
